  "_doc": [
    "Edit this file on the Replit server, then just restart the backend.",
    "The client downloads it from GET /api/signatures at start, so the .exe",
    "does NOT need rebuilding when you change anything here.",
    "matching = names/paths are compared with case, spaces, dots, dashes and",
    "underscores removed, on both sides. So 'N0Recoil', 'no_recoil' and",
    "'no recoil' are the same word. That also means a name containing a",
    "keyword matches, e.g. 'my-cheatengine-notes.txt' matches 'cheatengine'.",
    "severity = high   -> verdict CHEATER",
    "severity = medium -> verdict SUSPICIOUS (if no high)",
    "severity = low    -> info only, never changes the verdict",
    "",
    "READ THIS BEFORE ADDING A KEYWORD.",
    "Because matching is substring based, a keyword that also occurs inside an",
    "ordinary Windows/game word will fire on every clean machine. Measured on a",
    "stock Windows 11 + FiveM PC, these were all false CHEATER hits and are now",
    "gone - do not add them back:",
    "  walls    -> NetFirewallSecurityFilter.cmdletDefinition.cdxml",
    "  mapper   -> ResourceMapper.dll, reshade-...AdaptiveTonemapper.asm",
    "  triggers -> msmq-triggers-DL.man, Microsoft-Windows-msmq-triggers-*",
    "  magnet   -> c_magneticstripereader.inf",
    "  bypass   -> C:\\Windows\\System32\\oobe\\BypassNRO.cmd",
    "  rapidfire-> Rapidfire64.dll (Windows Fax), RapidFireServer64.dll",
    "  ceserver -> HyperV-IntegrationComponents-VirtualDevice-...cat",
    "  exec     -> anything containing 'execute'",
    "  phantom  -> Phantom (camera software)",
    "  profile  -> UserProfileWmiProvider.mof, WLAN_profile_v3.xsd, load_profile,",
    "              SteamIDProfilePage.res, ProfilerCore64.dll, profile.dat ...",
    "  trust    -> wintrust.dll, TrustedInstaller.exe, 'Trust Tokens', trusted_vault.pb",
    "  xinput   -> XInput1_4.dll, xinput1_3.dll, chxinputrouter.dll (every PC)",
    "  novert   -> icon_button_fullscreen_over.tga",
    "  powera   -> '08 - PowerAndSleep.lnk'",
    "  macro    -> ReShade Macros.fxh, helper-functions-and-macros.fxh",
    "  charles  -> 'Charles' is a first name;  cutter -> video cutters",
    "  taskmanager -> the Start Menu shortcut, present on every PC",
    "  sniffer    -> CodeSniffer.php (PHP), any packet sniffer",
    "  scriptfile -> Edge DevTools ...\\debugger\\images\\scriptfileicon.png",
    "  adminmenu  -> QBCore/ESX resources ship a resource literally named",
    "              qb-adminmenu, which also contains noclip.lua",
    "  ilspy      -> 'ut-ilspy.py' (utils.py)",
    "  reclass    -> Java/Kotlin B-INF output; whitelisted instead",
    "",
    "These are whitelisted rather than removed because a real cheat really can",
    "live there, and the file is a normal dev/build folder when it does not:",
    "  \\resources\\, \\txdata\\, \\server-resource-cache\\  FiveM server data",
    "  \\xampp\\, \\tomcat\\, \\webapps\\                   web dev server",
    "  \\binf\\                                          Java build output",
    "  \\utils.py, \\utils\\                              'utils.py' vs 'ilspy'",
    "  \\reshade-shaders\\, \\citizen\\scripting\\         ReShade / FiveM scripts",
    "",
    "Rule of thumb: add the CHEAT name, never the ordinary English word it is a",
    "substring of. Prefer compounds (rapidfiremacro, wallhack) over bare words",
    "(walls, mapper). Before you save, run: python client/selftest.py"
  ],

